The '''Crystal Nucleus''' is a location in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, mainly used to deposit collected [[Gemstone Crystals]] from expeditions.

{{ZoneText|Place all Crystals at the statues.}}
== Location ==
The '''Crystal Nucleus''' is always in the middle of the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} {{coords|512|Y|512}}. Players can travel to main areas of the map using each of {{green|4}} quadrants, as well as the {{Zone|Magma Fields}} directly below the platform. After the {{green|}} required Crystals ([[Jade Crystal|{{Green|Jade}}]], [[Amber Crystal|{{Gold|Amber}}]], [[Amethyst Crystal|{{Purple|Amethyst}}]], [[Sapphire Crystal|{{Aqua|Sapphire}}]], and [[Topaz Crystal|{{Yellow|Topaz}}]]) are delivered to their respective statues, a Crystal Nucleus Loot Bundle will appear in front of the vault opposite of the [[Topaz Crystal|{{Yellow|Topaz Crystal}}]] Statue.

Crystals will remain placed if you leave the game. They cannot be picked up once placed, nor can duplicate Crystals be obtained until all {{green|5}} Crystals are placed.

