== Loot ==
* Each '''Crystal Nucleus Bundle''' contains :
**{{green|14}}-{{green|19}}<ref>{{green|20}} is the actual upper bound but is excluded.</ref> pieces of random loot;
**{{green|1}} of every Fine [[Gemstone]] found in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} (e.g., not including {{Gray|Opal}}, {{DarkGray|Onyx}}, {{Blue|Aquamarine}}, {{Bronze|Citrine}}, and {{DarkGreen|Peridot}});
**{{HotM EXP|800}}. If the player is already [[Heart of the Mountain|{{Dark Purple|Heart of the Mountain 10}}]], this is replaced with a random amount between {{Green|2,000}}-{{Green|7,000}} of either {{Item|Mithril Powder}} or {{Item|Gemstone Powder}}. 

The number of drops can be increased in the following ways, up to a range of {{green|16}}-{{green|21}} rolls with a {{green|65%}} chance for a bonus roll:
*by {{green|1}}, using {{Item|Mole Pet}};
*by {{green|1}}, using [[Diamond Essence Shop#High Roller|Diamond Essence Shop perk "High Roller"]];
*by {{green|1}} at a {{green|5%→50%}} chance, using the {{AttributeLink|Bigger Box}} attribute ({{Item|Hideoncave Shard}});
**which can be boosted up to {{green|1.20x}}, using the {{AttributeLink|Echo of Boxes}} attribute ({{Item|Cuboa Shard}}),<br>resulting in a {{green|6%→60%}} chance from the {{AttributeLink|Bigger Box}} attribute ({{Item|Hideoncave Shard}});
***which can be boosted up to {{green|1.50x}}, using the {{AttributeLink|Echo of Echoes}} attribute ({{Item|Tiamat Shard}}); <br>resulting in a maximum multipler of {{green|1.30x}} from the {{AttributeLink|Bigger Box}} attribute ({{Item|Hideoncave Shard}});<br>resulting in a maximum chance range {{green|6.5%→65%}} chance from the {{AttributeLink|Bigger Box}} attribute ({{Item|Hideoncave Shard}}).

